              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Running a fleet isn’t just about putting trucks on the road; it’s about keeping them there, safely and efficiently. Whether you manage five vehicles or fifty, staying ahead of repairs, tracking performance, and protecting your drivers takes more than just good intentions; it takes the right tools. That’s where a fleet management system comes in.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we don’t just sell trucks. We help you manage them better. When you invest in an <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International truck</a>, you’re getting access to one of the most advanced fleet management ecosystems in the industry. From real-time diagnostics to predictive maintenance and driver behavior insights, these systems are designed to give you the control and visibility your business needs to succeed. Here’s how a fleet management system can transform your operation—and why it makes sense to pair it with an <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International truck</a>.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-is",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Is a Fleet Management System?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-is"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-is-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A fleet management system is a platform that helps you monitor, maintain, and optimize your fleet. It combines GPS tracking, telematics, vehicle diagnostics, maintenance scheduling, driver performance monitoring, and reporting all in one centralized interface. In simple terms, it gives you the information you need to make better decisions and keep your fleet running at its best.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-benefits",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Key Benefits of a Fleet Management System",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "benefits"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-benefits-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Modern <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">International trucks</a> are equipped with cutting-edge safety systems that help protect your drivers and cargo. Features like collision mitigation, lane departure warning, electronic stability control, and predictive cruise control aren’t just perks—they’re essential tools for safer, smarter driving. By helping prevent accidents and reducing wear on your truck, these systems also help protect your bottom line. Fewer incidents mean lower insurance costs, less downtime, and happier, more confident drivers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "numbered-benefits-2",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
