                            "align": "left"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "numbered-benefits-3-p1",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Safety is non-negotiable. Fleet management systems monitor driver behavior like speeding, harsh braking, idling, and more, so you can coach your team on safer habits and reduce the risk of accidents.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "numbered-benefits-3-p2",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "International’s built-in Diamond Logic® system enhances safety by integrating with sensors and controls to automate warnings, shutdowns, and other responses in real time. When paired with your fleet management system, it becomes a powerful way to keep your drivers protected and your assets secure.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
