                        },
                        {
                          "id": "numbered-benefits-6-p1",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "When a truck goes down, the clock starts ticking, and every minute matters. OnCommand® Connection provides instant alerts and remote diagnostics to help you react fast. You’ll know exactly what’s wrong, how urgent it is, and where to take the truck for service.",
