                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why International Trucks and Fleet Management Go Hand-in-Hand",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "hand-in-hand"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-hand-in-hand-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International trucks</a> are built with uptime in mind. But when paired with fleet management technology, they become an even more powerful tool for your business. Here’s why:",
