                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready to Run Smarter?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "run-smarter"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-run-smarter-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you’re still managing your fleet with spreadsheets and guesswork, it’s time to upgrade. A modern fleet management system helps you save money, protect your people, and make smarter decisions every day. And when it’s built into the <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International trucks</a> available at <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, you get the best of both worlds—advanced technology and reliable trucks that are ready to work. Ready to streamline your operations and improve your bottom line? <a href=\"/contact\">Contact Sun State International</a> and let’s build a smarter fleet together.",
